    "summary": "Added paid-only google/gemini-4-argon with a 1,048,576-token context window, text, image, audio and video input, text output, reasoning controls, tool calling and Google Search. Input, cached-input and output billing is per million tokens; Google Search is billed per 1,000 queries. Requests use Vertex global as the primary provider, with OpenRouter’s Google AI Studio standard tier as fallback; priority and flex tiers are excluded. Local end-to-end tests verified text, streaming with reasoning, image input, tools and Search on Vertex, plus streaming and tools on the fallback. Fallback Search returned a 429 during testing, while primary Search and plain fallback requests worked.",
